msgid "<0/> is big, and <1>suur maja</1> is a big house. The adjective goes into the same case as the noun: <2/>, in a big house; <3/>, a new book, as the object of <4>loen</4>, I’m reading. Each word builds the case on its own forms, so the endings can differ: <5>suurt maja</5>. Four endings work differently; a section below shows them."
msgstr "<0/> is big, and <1>suur maja</1> is a big house. The adjective goes into the same case as the noun: <2/>, in a big house; <3/>, a new book, as the object of <4>loen</4>, I’m reading. Each word builds the case on its own forms, so the endings can differ: <5>suurt maja</5>. Four endings work differently; a section below shows them."

